### Glean 账号与授权自测（5.7.3.2 全量接口）
### 用 IDEA 内置 HTTP Client 发送；成功响应统一为 {"code":"0","data":...}
@host = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@phone = 13800000000

### 1. 下发验证码（开发环境固定 123456）
POST {{host}}/auth/sms-code
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "{{phone}}" }

### 2. 登录（deviceId 对应 JWT 的 dev claim）
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "{{phone}}",
  "code": "123456",
  "deviceId": "dev-A",
  "platform": "Android"
}

### 3. 当前身份
# 注意：lvl 取自令牌，可能滞后于库中授权级别
GET {{host}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 4. 当前授权（默认 L1）
GET {{host}}/consent
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 5. 升到 L3（累进：L3 含 L2 能力）
PUT {{host}}/consent
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "level": "L3",
  "scope": {
    "notifyApps": ["com.tencent.mm", "com.taobao.taobao", "com.jd.jd"],
    "qqGroups": ["123456789", "987654321"],
    "quietHours": ["23:00", "07:00"]
  },
  "clientRequestId": "k-1"
}

### 6. 降到 L1 —— 响应里的 revoked 就是撤回影响面
PUT {{host}}/consent
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "level": "L1",
  "scope": {
    "notifyApps": ["com.tencent.mm"],
    "qqGroups": [],
    "quietHours": ["23:00", "07:00"]
  },
  "clientRequestId": "k-2"
}

### 7. 幂等：同键不同载荷 → 409 E5004
PUT {{host}}/consent
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "level": "L2",
  "scope": { "qqGroups": ["123456789"] },
  "clientRequestId": "k-2"
}

### 8. 设备列表
GET {{host}}/devices
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 9. 远程下线（幂等，重复调用仍 204）
DELETE {{host}}/devices/dev-B
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 10. 本人审计（游标分页）
GET {{host}}/audit?limit=3
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 11. 审计翻页：把上一页的 nextCursor 填进来
GET {{host}}/audit?limit=3&cursor={{next_cursor}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 12. 刷新令牌
POST {{host}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refresh_token}}" }

### 13. 登出（幂等；同设备 refresh token 一并失效）
POST {{host}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
